      "en": "“Why do we sit still? Assemble yourselves! Let’s enter into the fortified cities, and let’s be silent there; for the LORD our God has put us to silence, and given us poisoned water to drink, because we have sinned against the LORD.",
      "ko": "우리가 어찌 가만히 앉았으랴 모일찌어다 우리가 견고한 성읍들로나 들어가서 거기서 멸망하자 우리가 여호와께 범죄하였으므로 우리 하나님 여호와께서 우리를 멸하시며 우리에게 독한 물을 마시우심이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ddf149530581f57920013b182e876f731222cf46787e72b60b0b98f9031b0f0a",
      "translation_text_hash": "86882070b2df5cb57e8a0d8e4ea54a425de5b7c5e3136f0efacb70eb941cea45",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
