      "en": "Oh that I could comfort myself against sorrow! My heart is faint within me.",
      "ko": "슬프다 나의 근심이여 어떻게 위로를 얻을 수 있을까 나의 중심이 번뇌하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "7e9590c4d706ccadd3c90c4bd03b31081bdf9e497f08d9886752c0fd39f1bef4",
      "translation_text_hash": "45eec5c9cdf6f7eac6007f7c8b4c2f9a1d6779e466fc5da9522f6c2bc1cc7393",
