      "en": "For the hurt of the daughter of my people, I am hurt. I mourn. Dismay has taken hold of me.",
      "ko": "딸 내 백성이 상하였으므로 나도 상하여 슬퍼하며 놀라움에 잡혔도다",
      "source_text_hash": "337c33da07bb7984cb7fa4df4889d5e5ea25e5111b087ea6fd500ceaf81d1cea",
